{"version":1,"content":"<p>英特爾下一代伺服器處理器Xeon 7「Diamond Rapids」近日首次以實體形式公開亮相。網絡流傳的照片顯示，這款面向未來數據中心和人工智能基礎設施打造的旗艦級處理器已經完成封裝，標誌着產品研發正穩步邁向正式發佈階段。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585988.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T19:43:43.015002+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T19:30:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T19:36:57.977461+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T19:36:57.977461+00:00","content_hash":"0f31e7709d48199365e61602e9b014561678633e5094324ae3c3929e280e7660","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}